'''''Barbarea intermedia''''' ([[common name]] medium-flowered winter-cress<ref name="London">{{cite web |title=''Barbarea intermedia'' (Boreau) - Medium-Flowered Winter-Cress |url=https://www.nhm.ac.uk/our-science/data/uk-species/species/barbarea_intermedia.html |website=[[Natural History Museum, London]] |accessdate=21 August 2020}}</ref>) is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Brassicaceae]].<ref>{{cite web |title=''Barbarea intermedia'' |url=http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=110&taxon_id=200009239 |website=www.efloras.org |accessdate=21 August 2020}}</ref> It is native to northern Africa and many parts of Europe, and naturalized in some parts of [[Asia]], [[Africa]] and [[Europe]].<ref name="GRIN">{{GRIN | name =''Barbarea intermedia'' | id = 319675| access-date = 21 August 2020 }}</ref>

